.TH UBUNTU-CN-INPUT-DOCTOR 1 "2026-11-25" "Xiapin 2.0.6" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ubuntu-cn-input-doctor \- diagnose a Xiapin installation and desktop session
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ubuntu-cn-input-doctor
.br
.B ubuntu-cn-input-doctor --version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ubuntu-cn-input-doctor
checks the installed package, required programs and data files, UTF-8 locale,
CJK font, user service, GNOME input source, current IBus registry, Engine
process and permissions of local learning data.
.PP
The command does not modify package files, desktop settings or learning data.
It exits unsuccessfully when a required installation component is missing.
Session-specific conditions that may be normal outside a graphical login are
reported as warnings.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --version
Print the installed Xiapin version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/ibus/component/xiapin.xml
IBus component registration.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/xiapin/
Default location of private learning data.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ibus (1),
.BR ubuntu-cn-input-memory (1)
